msgstr ":ref:`Image UMAP <workflow-module-umap>`: Gefðu upp samsvarandi hnita-/eiginleikadálka þegar val er skilgreint."

msgid ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: Use the actual measured feature definitions and units."
msgstr ":ref:`Measure <workflow-module-measure>`: Notaðu raunverulegar skilgreiningar og einingar mældu eiginleikanna."

msgid ":ref:`Annotate <workflow-module-annotate>`: Apply compatible gates, then review candidate labels."
